  "title": "My Mom&#39;s Sausage &amp; Rice Casserole",
  "description": "This is my favorite casserole! It features pork sausage, rice, chicken soup mix, and vegetables. I grew up loving this and now I make it for my husband.",
  "authors": [
    "az_starshine"
  ],
